      <text x="1144" y="27" text-anchor="end" class="fill-dim font-mono text-[8px]">REV 582b69c · v0.16.0 · 2026-10-02</text>
      <text x="1144" y="38" text-anchor="end" class="fill-dim font-mono text-[8px]">kind "tools" · enabled_by_default False · no install extra</text>
      <text x="1144" y="63" text-anchor="end" class="fill-dim font-mono text-[9px]">what core provides · the plugin boundary · what the plugin owns · what you run</text>

